2231
01:45:06,310 --> 01:45:08,690
- Merle! - She's blushing. See her?
- 默尔 - 她脸红了 看见没？

2232
01:45:08,700 --> 01:45:09,870
What?
说什么呢

2233
01:45:10,870 --> 01:45:12,310
{\an8}（莫罗斯科剧院票 持票人马蒂·毛瑟）

2234
01:45:16,350 --> 01:45:22,760
{\an8}（马蒂 午夜到中央公园来见我 靠近第五大道960号那边 凯）

2235
01:45:50,670 --> 01:45:53,510
Take your stinking seat.
坐好别乱动

2236
01:45:59,860 --> 01:46:00,860
What the hell?
怎么回事？

2237
01:46:01,460 --> 01:46:03,960
Have you lost your damned mind?
你发什么神经？

2238
01:46:10,190 --> 01:46:12,730
Jed. I'm talking to you.
小杰 我在跟你说话呢

2239
01:46:13,320 --> 01:46:16,300
I was just practicing my aim, Mama.
妈 我只是练练枪法

2240
01:46:16,310 --> 01:46:19,450
You always said to shoot for the stars.
你不一直催我找准目标吗？

2241
01:46:27,010 --> 01:46:28,010
Hey.
嘿

2242
01:46:28,560 --> 01:46:29,560
Come.
跟我走

2243
01:46:31,100 --> 01:46:33,600
I'm sorry I'm late. I couldn't get away.
抱歉我来晚了 脱不开身

2244
01:46:33,620 --> 01:46:35,640
- Oh, I bet. - He was all over me.
- 呵 我信你 - 他一直缠着我

2245
01:46:35,660 --> 01:46:37,480
You were incredible tonight. That was unbelievable.
你今晚演得棒极了 太精彩了

2246
01:46:37,500 --> 01:46:39,420
- I have something for you. - For me?
- 我有样东西给你 - 给我？

2247
01:46:39,940 --> 01:46:40,940
Turn around.
转过去

2248
01:46:44,360 --> 01:46:47,680
Every year my husband gives me a piece of jewelry for our anniversary.
每周年我丈夫都会送我一件首饰

2249
01:46:48,440 --> 01:46:51,490
I have 25 of them. One for each year of misery.
我有25件了 每件都代表受了一年的苦

2250
01:46:52,180 --> 01:46:54,170
That should cover your trip and then some.
这条够你那趟路费了 没准还能剩

2251
01:46:55,270 --> 01:46:57,480
Wearing it makes me feel like shit.
戴着让我浑身不自在

2252
01:47:09,680 --> 01:47:11,510
Oh, shit. Stop, stop, stop.
完了 停下 停下 停下

2253
01:47:12,510 --> 01:47:13,520
Stop.
停

2254
01:47:51,390 --> 01:47:53,390
Hey! Hey, what are you doing?
喂 喂 你们在干什么呢？

2255
01:47:54,100 --> 01:47:56,720
- Shit. Oh, God. - Get up!
- 完了 天呐 - 站起来

2256
01:47:56,740 --> 01:47:59,050
- Lay still. - Stand up, I see you.
- 躺着别动 - 我看见你们了 站起来

2257
01:47:59,060 --> 01:48:02,050
When I tell you, run. One, two, three. Get up.
我数到三就跑 一 二 三 起来

2258
01:48:02,060 --> 01:48:04,060
- Come on. Go. - Hey!
- 快走 走 - 嘿

2259
01:48:04,070 --> 01:48:05,780
Joey, stop them!
乔伊 拦住他们

2260
01:48:05,800 --> 01:48:07,570
Come on. Come on. Come on.
快走 快走 快走

2261
01:48:07,590 --> 01:48:10,700
Hey. Hey. Where are you guys going? What are you guys doing here?
嘿 你们往哪儿去？跑这儿干嘛呢？

2262
01:48:10,720 --> 01:48:11,820
- Nothing. - No, no, no.
- 没干嘛 - 不 不 不

2263
01:48:11,840 --> 01:48:13,320
- Let me see both of your hands. - Cuff him.
- 把手举起来 - 铐上那小子

2264
01:48:13,340 --> 01:48:15,200
- Oh, my God. We were just... - We didn't do anything.
- 天呐 我们只是... - 我们什么都没干

2265
01:48:15,220 --> 01:48:18,160
Give us a break. We were looking for her earrings in the grass.
饶了我们吧 我们只是在草地上找她的耳环

2266
01:48:18,180 --> 01:48:20,250
My earring came off. We were looking for my earring.
我的耳环掉了 只是在耳环

2267
01:48:20,270 --> 01:48:22,370
It looks like you've got two earrings in your ears there.
你耳朵上不是戴了两只耳环吗

2268
01:48:22,380 --> 01:48:25,420
Not this earring. There was... From before. There was another earring.
不是这只 不是刚才掉的 还有一只

2269
01:48:25,440 --> 01:48:28,760
There's another pair of earrings from earlier in the day.
白天还丢过另一对耳环

2270
01:48:28,780 --> 01:48:30,210
I recognize you.
我认出你了

2271
01:48:30,220 --> 01:48:32,920
- Oh, God. Oh, God. - You're Kay Stone.
- 天呐 天呐 - 你是凯·斯通

2272
01:48:32,930 --> 01:48:35,260
- Yes. I know exactly who you are. - This is not happening.
- 没错 我太清楚你是谁了 - 见鬼了

2273
01:48:35,280 --> 01:48:37,310
- Let see your hands. - Are you serious?
- 把手给我 - 你认真的吗？

2274
01:48:37,330 --> 01:48:39,850
You know, I will go home,
这样吧 我回家取个钱包

2275
01:48:39,870 --> 01:48:42,360
and I'll get my wallet, and I will get you some cash
给你们些钱赔偿

2276
01:48:42,370 --> 01:48:43,910
because we've put you out.
毕竟给你们添麻烦了

2277
01:48:43,930 --> 01:48:46,430
Please, officer. She's gonna go home and get her wallet. And give you cash.
请你行行好 警官 她这就回家拿钱包 给你们现金

2278
01:48:46,440 --> 01:48:48,780
- Got ID? - No. No ID.
- 有证件吗？ - 没 没证件

2279
01:48:49,120 --> 01:48:50,720
- Cuff her. - No, please.
- 把她也铐上 - 不要 求你了

2280
01:48:50,730 --> 01:48:53,360
- No ID, huh? Let's see. - Please, please. No, no, no.
- 没证是吧？让我搜搜 - 求你了 求你了

2281
01:48:54,120 --> 01:48:56,080
- Please, will you just let me go home? - Come on.
- 求你了 让我回家拿钱包吧 - 求你了

2282
01:48:56,100 --> 01:48:57,540
I'll give you my word.
我向你保证

2283
01:48:57,560 --> 01:49:01,750
Wow, lookie here. That's a really nice necklace.
哇 瞧瞧 这项链可真漂亮啊

2284
01:49:01,760 --> 01:49:04,660
Take it. Take it. It's yours.
拿去 拿去吧 归你了

2285
01:49:04,670 --> 01:49:06,670
Thank you very much.
那我就不客气了

2286
01:49:07,320 --> 01:49:08,870
I can't believe this.
真不敢相信

2287
01:49:09,670 --> 01:49:11,510
Do you think you could grab me another necklace?
能再拿条项链给我吗？

2288
01:49:11,530 --> 01:49:12,590
Are you serious?
你是认真的吗？

2289
01:49:12,610 --> 01:49:14,710
You said them mean nothing to you. It'd just take you a couple of minutes.
你不是说这项链对你没价值吗 就几分钟的事

2290
01:49:14,720 --> 01:49:17,210
I was just gone for half an hour. I can't go up and come right back down.
我都消失了半小时 不能进去又立刻出来

2291
01:49:17,220 --> 01:49:19,600
- You'd do that for the police officers. - My mother is up there.
- 你给警察倒是挺爽快的啊 - 我妈就在屋里

2292
01:49:19,620 --> 01:49:22,140
- Oh, my God. My hair. - I'll wait in the hall.
- 天呐 我的头发都乱了 - 我在走廊等你

2293
01:49:22,160 --> 01:49:23,580
No, you will not.
不 不准跟来

2294
01:49:24,820 --> 01:49:26,570
Wait. Wait.
等等 等等

2295
01:49:28,030 --> 01:49:29,450
There.
好了

2296
01:49:29,470 --> 01:49:30,470
You look beautiful.
你真漂亮

2297
01:49:31,530 --> 01:49:32,930
Please, you have 25 of them.
求你了 你有25条呢

2298
01:49:32,950 --> 01:49:34,420
Fine!
好

2299
01:49:34,590 --> 01:49:36,830
- Stay here. Do you understand me? - I'll stay here. Okay.
- 待在这儿 明白吗？ - 好 我就在这里等

2300
01:49:36,840 --> 01:49:38,280
- Do not move. - Okay.
- 别乱跑 - 好

2301
01:49:46,380 --> 01:49:47,460
Shit.
倒霉

2302
01:49:55,420 --> 01:49:57,800
Hello. Lovely to see you.
你好 很高兴见到你们

2303
01:49:57,810 --> 01:50:00,520
- David, how are you? - Good. How are you?
- 大卫 你好吗？ - 挺好 你呢？

2304
01:50:05,560 --> 01:50:07,400
Where the fuck have you been?
你死哪去了？

2305
01:50:07,420 --> 01:50:09,730
I needed a moment to myself. Is that a problem?
我出去透透气 有意见吗？

2306
01:50:09,750 --> 01:50:11,940
I didn't realize I needed a permission slip.
出门还得请示吗？

2307
01:50:11,960 --> 01:50:15,110
I put this whole thing on for you and you're making me look like an idiot.
我为你操办了这一切 你现在却让我丢面子

2308
01:50:15,120 --> 01:50:15,910
God.
天呐

2309
01:50:15,930 --> 01:50:19,180
Look. Merle's on the phone right now with The New York Times.
听着 默尔已经跟《纽约时报》那边联系上了

2310
01:50:19,190 --> 01:50:21,910
- What? - He's got a printer who's gonna read the review.
- 真的假的？ - 他找到个能念出明天剧评的人

2311
01:50:21,930 --> 01:50:22,570
My God.
天呐

2312
01:50:22,580 --> 01:50:24,660
- Or do you not care? - I got him! I have him!
- 你在乎不在乎？ - 找着他了 我找着他了

2313
01:50:24,680 --> 01:50:26,520
- Oh, my God. Okay. - Come, come, come!
- 天呐 来了 - 快来 快来

2314
01:50:26,540 --> 01:50:27,660
Coming!
来了

2315
01:50:27,670 --> 01:50:29,380
- Hurry, he has the review! - I'm coming.
- 快点 拿到剧评了 - 来了

2316
01:50:29,400 --> 01:50:30,750
The review!
剧评出来了

2317
01:50:30,770 --> 01:50:32,260
Come on, come on, come on, come on.
快点 快点 快点

2318
01:50:32,280 --> 01:50:34,090
- Come on, come on. - Okay.
- 快来 - 来了

2319
01:50:34,110 --> 01:50:36,090
Raoul, Kay.
这是拉乌尔 她是凯

2320
01:50:36,110 --> 01:50:40,850
Okay. Title, "Kay Stone Returns" by Robert...
好 标题是《凯·斯通复出》 作者罗伯特...

2321
01:50:52,440 --> 01:50:54,650
- Have a good night. - Leave it open. Everyone's coming down.
- 晚安 - 别关门 大家都要下来了

2322
01:50:54,670 --> 01:50:55,840
- Are they? - Oh, yeah.
- 是吗？ - 是的

2323
01:50:56,530 --> 01:50:57,690
Party's over.
庆祝会结束了

2324
01:50:59,030 --> 01:51:00,030
Good night.
晚安

2325
01:51:07,410 --> 01:51:08,910
The party's over.
庆祝会结束了

2326
01:51:10,670 --> 01:51:13,210
- They're asking us to leave. - What do you mean? We just got here.
- 他们说散场了 - 什么意思？咱们才刚到啊

2327
01:51:13,230 --> 01:51:15,720
They should've stopped us at the door. Why'd they let us in?
怎么门口不拦还让我们进？

2328
01:51:15,730 --> 01:51:17,630
It's done, the party's gone.
完了 聚会没了

2329
01:51:20,390 --> 01:51:22,140
Excuse me. Do you know where Kay is?
打扰下 请问凯在哪儿？

2330
01:51:22,160 --> 01:51:24,580
- She's upstairs in her bedroom. - Okay.
- 她在楼上卧室里 - 好的

2331
01:52:11,330 --> 01:52:13,250
Hi. Is Kay in there?
嗨 凯在屋里吗？

2332
01:52:13,440 --> 01:52:15,600
This is not a good time.
现在不方便

2333
01:52:15,610 --> 01:52:17,610
Okay, but can I just speak to her?
明白 能让我跟她说下吗

2334
01:52:17,630 --> 01:52:20,550
As I said, it's really not a good time.
我都说了 现在真不方便

2335
01:52:51,850 --> 01:52:54,730
At the end of the year, if the guy made you money, you keep him.
年底结账 能赚钱的就留着

2336
01:52:54,750 --> 01:52:57,440
And if not, you throw the bum out.
不赚钱的就踢出去呗

2337
01:52:57,460 --> 01:52:58,710
Excuse me.
打扰下

2338
01:53:00,430 --> 01:53:02,200
- Hi. - You gotta be kidding me.
- 您好 - 开啥玩笑啊

2339
01:53:02,220 --> 01:53:05,150
- I'm sorry to disturb you in your home. - How did you fuck get in my house?
- 抱歉登门打扰了 - 你怎么混进我家的？

2340
01:53:05,170 --> 01:53:07,850
Please give me another chance. I am on my hands and knees.
求您再给我一次机会 我求您了

2341
01:53:07,870 --> 01:53:11,380
I need a ride to Japan and I need $1,500 so I can compete in the championship.
我得去日本 还需要1500块才能参加世锦赛

2342
01:53:11,400 --> 01:53:13,790
I need this job very, very badly.
这活对我太重要了

2343
01:53:13,810 --> 01:53:15,330
I'm begging you.
我求您了

2344
01:53:15,350 --> 01:53:18,490
I'll work for you however you want. I will lose.
我完全听您安排 输球也行

2345
01:53:18,510 --> 01:53:22,240
I'll have no personal point of view apart from making your event a success.
我唯一目标就是把您的活动办成功

2346
01:53:22,260 --> 01:53:25,140
Marty, there are no second chances in life.
马蒂 人生没有第二次机会

2347
01:53:25,160 --> 01:53:27,570
- Why not? - I offered you the job and you said no!
- 为什么不行？ - 我给过你机会 你当时拒绝了

2348
01:53:27,590 --> 01:53:30,340
I know, because I was impulsive. And I regret it.
我知道 我当时太冲动了 我很后悔

2349
01:53:30,350 --> 01:53:31,480
And?
除了后悔呢？

2350
01:53:31,490 --> 01:53:34,360
And I was rude and overconfident.
我还没礼貌 还自负

2351
01:53:34,380 --> 01:53:36,320
And I was cocky, and I copped an attitude.
我得意忘形 还耍架子

2352
01:53:36,330 --> 01:53:37,150
And?
还有呢？

2353
01:53:37,170 --> 01:53:39,080
And it won't happen again. I'm sorry.
我保证不会再犯了 对不起

2354
01:53:39,090 --> 01:53:41,490
Please just give me another chance, Mr. Rockwell.
求您再给我一回机会 罗克韦尔先生

2355
01:53:42,280 --> 01:53:44,970
I'm throwing myself at your mercy. I'll do whatever you want.
我任您发落 您吩咐什么我就做什么

2356
01:53:44,990 --> 01:53:47,240
What do you guys think? Should I give this little asshole a second chance?
你们怎么看？该给这小混蛋一次机会吗？

2357
01:53:47,260 --> 01:53:48,910
- Yes, please! - Don't ask me.
- 是的 求您了 - 别问我

2358
01:53:48,930 --> 01:53:51,730
You don't know how important this is to me. Please. I'm begging you.
这对我太重要了 求求您了

2359
01:53:51,750 --> 01:53:54,310
Just let me go on your plane, and let me join you there.
求您让我跟您上飞机去日本

2360
01:53:54,320 --> 01:53:56,210
Please, I'm humbling myself before you.
求求您了 我正跪着求您

2361
01:53:56,230 --> 01:53:58,620
- You're making me sick. - I'm sorry.
- 你这副模样真恶心 - 对不起

2362
01:53:58,630 --> 01:54:00,220
- Stand up! - Okay. All right.
- 站起来! - 好的 行

2363
01:54:00,810 --> 01:54:03,770
Please. Okay? I'll do anything.
求您了 让我做什么都行

2364
01:54:03,790 --> 01:54:05,750
- Anything? - Yes. Anything.
- 什么都行？ - 对 什么都行

2365
01:54:06,280 --> 01:54:07,360
Okay.
好

2366
01:54:07,370 --> 01:54:10,850
Go down the hall. Second door on the right is my office.
顺着走廊走 右手边第二间是我办公室

2367
01:54:10,860 --> 01:54:13,540
Grab the paddle and bring it back here.
去把球拍拿来

2368
01:54:13,550 --> 01:54:15,770
This is more dramatic than the play.
这要比刚才那出戏还精彩了

2369
01:54:15,790 --> 01:54:17,540
- Okay. - That's true.
- 好的 - 可不是吗

2370
01:54:20,810 --> 01:54:22,520
{\an8}（罗克韦尔墨业）

2371
01:54:34,690 --> 01:54:36,650
Oh, Marty. Give me the paddle.
马蒂 把球拍给我

2372
01:54:38,000 --> 01:54:40,040
So here's what I want you to do.
照我说的做

2373
01:54:40,060 --> 01:54:43,230
I want you to bend over that chair and drop your pants.
我要你趴那椅子上 把裤子脱了

2374
01:54:45,290 --> 01:54:46,660
Are you for real?
你认真的吗？

2375
01:54:46,680 --> 01:54:49,140
You've been a really bad boy. Now you're gonna get a spanking.
你这小子调皮过头了 得好好打屁股了

2376
01:54:49,160 --> 01:54:50,830
Come on. Are you serious?
别这样 你认真的吗？

2377
01:54:50,850 --> 01:54:52,180
You wanna get to Japan, don't you?
想去日本吗？

2378
01:54:52,200 --> 01:54:54,270
Yeah, I wanna go to Japan. But this is what you want?
是的 我想去日本 可这真是你想要的？

2379
01:54:54,290 --> 01:54:56,690
That's what it's gonna take. Now bend over.
这就是代价 趴好

2380
01:54:59,650 --> 01:55:01,240
Okay, so to be clear,
好吧 先说好

2381
01:55:01,250 --> 01:55:04,610
you're gonna bring me to Japan and then you're gonna compensate me?
你会带我去日本 然后还给我钱吗？

2382
01:55:04,620 --> 01:55:07,270
Tomorrow morning, 8:30, LaGuardia. We're on our way to Japan.
明早八点半 拉瓜迪亚机场 我们就动身去日本

2383
01:55:07,280 --> 01:55:09,400
- Do I need a ticket? - I own the plane.
- 还要买票吗？ - 飞机是我的

2384
01:55:09,420 --> 01:55:11,180
How do I know you're gonna honor this?
我怎么知道你说话算数？

2385
01:55:11,200 --> 01:55:15,070
You don't. Because you have no power here.
你不知道 你没资格跟我讨价还价

2386
01:55:15,090 --> 01:55:16,510
Now bend over.
趴好

2387
01:55:30,730 --> 01:55:33,100
Put your hands over here. I want a nice arc.
手放这儿 弧度要漂亮点

2388
01:55:35,000 --> 01:55:36,220
Let's go.
趴好

2389
01:55:36,500 --> 01:55:37,800
Oh, my God.
噢 天呐

2390
01:55:39,090 --> 01:55:40,840
Okay, I'm ready.
行了 我准备好了

2391
01:55:42,630 --> 01:55:44,840
This one is for my son.
这一下是替我儿子打的

2392
01:55:48,110 --> 01:55:49,570
Okay.
好

2393
01:55:49,580 --> 01:55:51,290
This one is for me.
这一下是给我解气的

2394
01:55:52,660 --> 01:55:54,200
God!
哎呦

2395
01:55:54,230 --> 01:55:55,850
Now the bonus round.
下面是加赛环节

2396
01:55:58,630 --> 01:56:03,170
Beautiful paddle. One side's wood and the other is foam.
多好的球拍 一面是木头 一面是海绵

2397
01:56:16,390 --> 01:56:19,230
- Hey, Marty, how you doin'? - Hey, Ted. Hey, Lawrence.
- 嘿 马蒂 怎么样？ - 你好 泰德 你好 劳伦斯

2398
01:56:19,240 --> 01:56:20,850
Aw, damn. Hey, man. How you doin'?
嘿 近来可好？

2399
01:56:20,860 --> 01:56:22,680
You think I could stay in the back room tonight?
你看我今晚能住后屋吗？

2400
01:56:22,690 --> 01:56:25,140
- Wow, man. I got Brian staying there tonight. - I get it. All right.
- 真不巧 后屋今晚给布赖恩了 - 好吧

2401
01:56:25,150 --> 01:56:28,110
I would let you stay at the house, man, but the wife ain't havin' it.
我真想让你到我家歇 但我老婆不答应

2402
01:56:28,130 --> 01:56:30,240
No, It's all right. I'm just gonna hang around until my flight.
没事 我就在这儿晃悠到起飞吧

2403
01:56:30,260 --> 01:56:31,410
Where you goin'?
你要去哪?

2404
01:56:31,430 --> 01:56:33,030
Going to Japan. Tomorrow morning, 8:00 a.m.
去日本 明早八点出发

2405
01:56:33,050 --> 01:56:34,780
- Oh, yeah! - My man!
- 太好了 - 好样的小伙子

2406
01:56:34,790 --> 01:56:37,290
- Yo, you goin'! You got that money. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- 哟 你真要去啦 弄到钱了 - 是啊 是啊

2407
01:56:37,310 --> 01:56:39,150
Good for you, man.
祝贺你 小伙计

2408
01:56:39,160 --> 01:56:40,860
You ain't even look like you excited.
你表情怎么这么沉啊

2409
01:56:40,870 --> 01:56:43,470
No, I'm-- I'm good. I'm good.
没事 我...挺好的 我挺好的

2410
01:56:43,480 --> 01:56:46,550
You know your boy back there, Wally, he's been waitin' on you.
你那哥们沃利在后头 他一直在等你

2411
01:56:46,570 --> 01:56:47,960
- Wally's here? - Wally, yeah.
- 沃利在这儿吗？ - 沃利在啊

2412
01:56:47,980 --> 01:56:50,380
- How'd he seem? - Wally's good. He cool, man.
- 他怎么样？ - 沃利挺好 挺淡定的 伙计

2413
01:56:50,400 --> 01:56:51,680
He's back there somewhere.
他就在里面

2414
01:56:51,700 --> 01:56:54,990
- He believes in you. - He has a dollar. She has a dollar.
- 他很看好你 - 当时大家都在掏钱

2415
01:56:55,510 --> 01:56:57,770
Hey. How you doing?
嘿 你好

2416
01:56:58,650 --> 01:57:01,010
Oh, wow! How you doing? Nice to see you!
噢 哇 见到你真好

2417
01:57:01,020 --> 01:57:02,600
I've been trying to get in touch with you.
我一直想联系你

2418
01:57:02,620 --> 01:57:05,150
- Oh, really? - Yeah. How's your dog? How's Moses doing?
- 真的？ - 是啊 你家狗怎样了 摩西怎么样？

2419
01:57:05,170 --> 01:57:06,320
You wanna cut the bullshit?
你能别扯了吗？

2420
01:57:06,340 --> 01:57:08,110
No bullshit. I'm genuinely concerned about him.
没胡扯 我是真关心那狗的

2421
01:57:08,130 --> 01:57:09,690
- Marty, Marty, Marty. You good, man? - Yeah, I'm good.
- 马蒂 马蒂 有麻烦吗？ - 没事 没事

2422
01:57:09,710 --> 01:57:11,740
Now, listen to me. Listen. Listen. Listen.
听着 听着 听着

2423
01:57:11,760 --> 01:57:15,040
I got your girl downstairs in the car. She's waiting for you.
你那小妞就在楼下车里 她正等你呢

2424
01:57:15,060 --> 01:57:17,120
What the fuck are you telling me? You got Rachel?
你扯什么呢？你抓了瑞秋？

2425
01:57:17,140 --> 01:57:18,190
Yeah.
对

2426
01:57:18,200 --> 01:57:21,660
She told me my dog's in Jersey somewhere. And you got the address.
她跟我说狗在新泽西某处 你知道地址

2427
01:57:21,670 --> 01:57:23,120
- Okay. - Let's go.
- 好 - 咱们走

2428
01:57:23,130 --> 01:57:25,670
Okay. All right. Let me, uh...
行吧 好吧 让我...

2429
01:57:25,690 --> 01:57:28,250
Um, okay, let me just...
额 行吧 让我先...

2430
01:57:28,270 --> 01:57:30,870
Give me two seconds. I just wanna say one thing to my friend.
给我两秒钟 我就跟我哥们说句话

2431
01:57:30,880 --> 01:57:33,130
Give you two seconds, yeah, but I'm not gonna be here.
给你两秒钟行 但老子可不等你

2432
01:57:33,150 --> 01:57:35,090
- Where you gonna be? - Where am I gonna be?
- 不等我你干嘛？ - 我干嘛？

2433
01:57:35,110 --> 01:57:38,430
I'm gonna be downstairs taking a hammer to your girl's stomach.
我这就下楼用锤子敲烂她那肚子

2434
01:57:38,450 --> 01:57:39,940
That's where I'm gonna be.
这就是我要干的事

2435
01:57:41,110 --> 01:57:43,570
Okay. All right. All right.
好 好 好

2436
01:57:43,590 --> 01:57:44,970
Yo, Mouse!
喂 小毛毛

2437
01:57:47,020 --> 01:57:49,100
- Come on. Let's go. - Okay.
- 走 别磨蹭 - 好吧

2438
01:57:51,120 --> 01:57:53,950
Well, I took most of his share of the money that our parents left us.
他的遗产大部分也被我拿了

2439
01:57:53,970 --> 01:57:56,450
- You spent your brother's money? - Yes, I did.
- 你拿了你弟那份？ - 是的

2440
01:57:56,470 --> 01:57:57,780
Yeah, you love your brother?
呵 看来你挺疼你弟的

2441
01:57:57,800 --> 01:58:01,080
Yeah. Maybe you could give my brother a job. You know he's a good man.
疼啊 要不你给我弟安排个差事 他人不错

2442
01:58:01,100 --> 01:58:03,380
I'll give him your job, okay? Mitch, do me a favor.
让他取代你 行了吧？米奇 帮个忙

2443
01:58:03,640 --> 01:58:04,640
What?
干嘛？

2444
01:58:04,910 --> 01:58:07,160
Stop talking. Okay?
闭嘴 行吗？

2445
01:58:12,280 --> 01:58:14,330
Okay. See the gas station there?
好了 看到那加油站没？

2446
01:58:15,140 --> 01:58:16,340
it's the house to the left.
往左那个房子就是

2447
01:58:16,350 --> 01:58:17,330
- Next left? - Yeah.
- 前面左转？ - 对

2448
01:58:17,350 --> 01:58:18,350
I got it.
知道了

2449
01:58:37,700 --> 01:58:40,120
Get out of the car. Come on.
下车 赶紧的

2450
01:58:40,680 --> 01:58:41,770
Mitch, come.
米奇 下来

2451
01:58:42,450 --> 01:58:45,460
- Reuben, you wait with her. - Oh, okay.
- 鲁本 你留下看着她 - 好的

2452
01:58:47,470 --> 01:58:48,650
Sit tight.
老实坐着

2453
01:59:06,020 --> 01:59:07,020
Come on. Louder.
快点 使劲敲

2454
01:59:07,680 --> 01:59:08,970
Knock louder.
使劲敲

2455
01:59:14,600 --> 01:59:15,890
That's my dog.
那是我的狗

2456
01:59:16,860 --> 01:59:19,120
Moses! Yo!
摩西 喂

2457
01:59:19,270 --> 01:59:20,390
Open up!
赶紧开门

2458
01:59:21,270 --> 01:59:23,940
Fuck. Moses.
真黑 摩西

2459
01:59:24,880 --> 01:59:27,570
- Come on. - I hate that fuckin' mutt.
- 开门 - 我讨厌死那狗了

2460
01:59:27,590 --> 01:59:29,590
Moses!
摩西

2461
01:59:31,680 --> 01:59:32,890
Moses!
摩西

2462
01:59:33,510 --> 01:59:35,310
That's my dog. Moses!
那是我的狗 摩西

2463
01:59:35,870 --> 01:59:36,870
Moses!
摩西

2464
01:59:37,810 --> 01:59:39,230
See anything in there?
里头看见啥没？

2465
01:59:39,250 --> 01:59:40,580
No, not really.
没 没看到什么

2466
01:59:46,600 --> 01:59:48,270
- Marty! - Shit.
- 马蒂 - 该死

2467
01:59:49,480 --> 01:59:50,980
Marty! Go!
马蒂 快跑

2468
01:59:54,110 --> 01:59:55,480
Marty!
马蒂

2469
02:00:01,280 --> 02:00:02,580
Get down! Get down!
趴下 趴下

2470
02:00:09,150 --> 02:00:10,150
Fuck!
该死

2471
02:00:17,010 --> 02:00:19,630
Marty! Marty! I got shot!
马蒂 马蒂 我中弹了

2472
02:00:19,830 --> 02:00:20,830
Help!
救命

2473
02:00:21,390 --> 02:00:23,430
Help, Marty! Please help!
救命 马蒂 快帮帮我

2474
02:00:23,450 --> 02:00:24,450
Help!
帮帮我

2475
02:00:26,120 --> 02:00:28,790
Are you okay? Oh, no! Are you okay?
你没事吧？噢不 你没事吧？

2476
02:00:28,810 --> 02:00:30,190
- Are you okay? - What the fuck's going on?
- 你没事吧？ - 这他妈是怎么回事？

2477
02:00:30,210 --> 02:00:31,650
Okay. It's okay.
好了 没事的

2478
02:00:31,670 --> 02:00:33,560
I'm bleeding, I'm bleeding.
我流血了 流血了

2479
02:00:33,570 --> 02:00:35,440
Okay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
好了 没事的 没事的 没事的

2480
02:00:40,980 --> 02:00:42,690
- I'm so sorry. - I'm sorry.
- 真对不起 - 对不起

2481
02:00:42,700 --> 02:00:44,020
- Go get the money. - What money?
- 快去拿钱 - 什么钱？

2482
02:00:44,030 --> 02:00:47,070
Go get the money. It's in his pocket. It's in his pocket.
快去拿钱 就在他口袋里 在他兜里

2483
02:00:47,080 --> 02:00:48,160
Are you sure?
你确定？

2484
02:00:48,180 --> 02:00:50,930
- The money! It's in the inside pocket! - Okay, okay, okay.
- 钱 就在他口袋里 - 好的 知道了 知道了

2485
02:01:03,220 --> 02:01:05,140
Oh, fuck.
该死

2486
02:01:12,080 --> 02:01:14,190
What is this?
这都是什么啊

2487
02:01:16,570 --> 02:01:17,860
Oh, you motherfucker...
噢 你个王八蛋...

2488
02:01:33,830 --> 02:01:36,960
Okay. Okay. Okay. Okay.
好了 好了 没事了 没事了

2489
02:01:40,560 --> 02:01:41,810
Fuck!
该死

2490
02:01:44,780 --> 02:01:47,620
Get off me! Where do you think you're going?
放手 你要去哪儿？

2491
02:01:47,630 --> 02:01:48,800
it's okay.
没事的

2492
02:01:50,620 --> 02:01:51,700
Okay.
好了

2493
02:01:53,390 --> 02:01:55,990
- You got it? You got it? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.
- 拿到了吗？拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了

2494
02:01:56,000 --> 02:01:57,370
- You got the money? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.
- 钱拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了

2495
02:01:57,390 --> 02:01:59,430
- Is there a lot of money? - There's a lot.
- 钱多吗？ - 很多 很多

2496
02:01:59,450 --> 02:02:01,580
- You can go now. - I know. You did amazing.
- 你能去日本了 - 我知道 你做得真棒

2497
02:02:01,600 --> 02:02:03,710
- You can go on your trip now. - I knew you could do this. So good.
- 你可以去参赛了 - 我就知道你行 太棒了

2498
02:02:03,720 --> 02:02:05,150
You did such a good job.
你帮了大忙

2499
02:02:05,170 --> 02:02:07,170
I love you.
我爱你

2500
02:02:07,890 --> 02:02:10,540
- Honey, when is your due date? - Why? Is the baby okay?
- 你预产期什么时候？ - 怎么了？孩子没事吧？

2501
02:02:10,560 --> 02:02:12,820
The baby is fine. I just need you to calm down.
孩子没事 你得冷静下来

2502
02:02:12,830 --> 02:02:14,750
- Are you the husband? - No. I'm her friend.
- 你是她丈夫吗？ - 不是 我是她朋友

2503
02:02:14,770 --> 02:02:16,830
She's due in four weeks. The baby will be okay?
她还有四周就生 孩子会没事吧？

2504
02:02:16,850 --> 02:02:18,430
The baby is okay. It's time to say goodbye.
孩子没事 你不能进了

2505
02:02:18,440 --> 02:02:20,460
- I can't go? - Only family in the operating room.
- 我不能进？ - 手术室只允许家属进去

2506
02:02:20,480 --> 02:02:22,130
No, no, no, no, no!
不 不 不 不 不

2507
02:02:22,150 --> 02:02:24,030
It's gonna be fine. Rachel, it's fine. It's fine.
会没事的 瑞秋 都会没事的 放心

2508
02:02:24,050 --> 02:02:26,090
No, no, no! Marty, no.
不 不 不 马蒂 别走

2509
02:02:26,110 --> 02:02:27,550
He'll be right outside.
他就在外面等着

2510
02:02:27,560 --> 02:02:28,920
Marty, no!
马蒂 别走

2511
02:02:28,930 --> 02:02:30,890
Rachel, I can't go. They're telling me I can't go.
瑞秋 我进不去 他们不让我进

2512
02:02:30,910 --> 02:02:32,480
- I don't want you to-- - Please calm down.
- 我不想让你... - 冷静下来

2513
02:02:32,500 --> 02:02:34,030
- Marty, don't go, please! - Please try calm down.
- 马蒂 别走 求你别走 - 冷静点

2514
02:02:34,040 --> 02:02:36,580
Please don't go! Marty!
求你别走 马蒂

2515
02:02:38,430 --> 02:02:40,180
No!
不要

2516
02:02:48,080 --> 02:02:49,990
Thank you very much. Welcome to Japan, Mr. Rockwell.
罗克韦尔先生 欢迎来到日本 祝您愉快

2517
02:02:50,010 --> 02:02:51,470
- Thank you. - Thank you.
- 谢谢 - 谢谢

2518
02:03:05,040 --> 02:03:07,890
{\an8}（行李领取处）

2519
02:03:16,620 --> 02:03:19,090
{\an8}（日本 东京）

2520
02:03:44,250 --> 02:03:46,960
{\an8}（罗克韦尔 原子笔）

2521
02:03:49,400 --> 02:03:51,470
（日语）好了 下一轮比赛

2522
02:03:51,480 --> 02:03:53,470
（日语）马上就要开始了

2523
02:03:51,480 --> 02:03:54,800
{\an8}（赢一分 得一笔）
（远藤加油 争创佳绩）
（用罗克韦尔书写传奇）

2524
02:03:56,050 --> 02:03:59,260
- （日语）这位挑战者是早川先生 大家掌声欢迎
- （日语）远藤加油

2525
02:04:00,440 --> 02:04:01,930
（日语）你有信心吗？

2526
02:04:02,250 --> 02:04:03,430
（日语）有

2527
02:04:03,510 --> 02:04:05,330
（日语）加油 加油

2528
02:04:05,380 --> 02:04:07,110
（日语）让我们拭目以待

2529
02:04:07,480 --> 02:04:09,810
（日语）那么接下来有请

2530
02:04:09,830 --> 02:04:11,930
（日语）远藤出场

2531
02:04:13,110 --> 02:04:15,920
{\an8}（世界第二 马蒂·毛瑟 最终落败）

2532
02:04:16,060 --> 02:04:17,450
（日语）有点可惜

2533
02:04:17,470 --> 02:04:19,280
- （日语）远藤加油
- （日语）下面请下一位挑战者上场

2534
02:04:19,740 --> 02:04:21,540
Mr. Mauser. Mr. Mauser.
毛瑟先生 毛瑟先生

2535
02:04:21,550 --> 02:04:25,180
Ah. Mr. Rockwell says the back of the line.
罗克韦尔说让你排到最后

2536
02:04:26,040 --> 02:04:28,380
He doesn't want to begin yet.
他还不想让你上场

2537
02:04:37,010 --> 02:04:39,970
{\an8}（挑战者在此排队）

2538
02:04:42,910 --> 02:04:44,510
（日语）这位才11岁...

2539
02:04:51,190 --> 02:04:53,820
{\an8}（世锦赛售票处）

2540
02:04:55,490 --> 02:04:56,500
（日语）谢谢

2541
02:05:03,200 --> 02:05:06,530
- Practice beer "biiru". - Okay, kanpai.
- 跟我学 日语管啤酒叫“比鲁” - 来 干杯

2542
02:05:06,550 --> 02:05:08,610
Mr. Sethi? Mr. Sethi.
塞西先生 塞西先生

2543
02:05:08,620 --> 02:05:10,710
Hey. It's me. It's Marty Mauser.
嘿 是我 马蒂·毛瑟

2544
02:05:10,730 --> 02:05:12,960
How you doing? I'm surprised to see you here, actually.
你好啊 真没想到能在这碰到您

2545
02:05:12,970 --> 02:05:15,060
- Why's that? - I don't know. I--
- 此话怎讲？ - 我不知道 我...

2546
02:05:15,080 --> 02:05:16,370
We do have a tournament to promote.
我们来这里宣传锦标赛

2547
02:05:16,380 --> 02:05:18,130
No, of course, of course.
嗯 当然 当然

2548
02:05:19,000 --> 02:05:20,000
Yeah.
好吧

2549
02:05:20,670 --> 02:05:23,450
I think I owe you an apology for the way I acted in London.
我想给您道个歉 伦敦的事

2550
02:05:23,460 --> 02:05:24,380
I was a jackass.
那确实不像话

2551
02:05:24,400 --> 02:05:26,750
There is such a thing as a code of courtesy, Mr. Mauser.
做人要有分寸 毛瑟先生

2552
02:05:26,760 --> 02:05:28,080
No, I know, I know. It's just--
对 我知道 我知道 只是...

2553
02:05:28,880 --> 02:05:30,300
It's every man for himself where I come from.
我出身的环境

2554
02:05:30,310 --> 02:05:31,930
That's just how I grew up. Okay?
为了混口饭谁都不讲究 懂吗？

2555
02:05:31,950 --> 02:05:33,600
And sometimes I feel like I don't even have control--
有时候我老毛病也会犯...

2556
02:05:33,610 --> 02:05:35,360
I'm really not interested in your excuses.
我不想听这些借口

2557
02:05:35,380 --> 02:05:37,010
No, no, I know. It's not an excuse.
不 不 知道 这不是借口

2558
02:05:37,020 --> 02:05:39,570
Look, the point is I'm gonna proceed with a much better attitude.
我会改掉那些做派

2559
02:05:39,590 --> 02:05:41,680
And by the way, if you see me acting rude up there today,
要是今天我上台表现粗鲁

2560
02:05:41,690 --> 02:05:44,690
that's a character. This is scripted. I'm gonna lose 21-14.
那是演的 事先安排好的 我会以21比14输掉

2561
02:05:44,710 --> 02:05:48,050
